@CountryRouteApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5003

### Valid route to Panama
GET {{{{CountryRouteApi_HostAddress}}}}/PAN
Accept: application/json

### Valid route to Belize
GET {{{{CountryRouteApi_HostAddress}}}}/BLZ
Accept: application/json

### Case insensitive request
GET {{{{CountryRouteApi_HostAddress}}}}/pan
Accept: application/json

### Unsupported country
GET {{{{CountryRouteApi_HostAddress}}}}/ABC
Accept: application/json

### Invalid country code
GET {{{{CountryRouteApi_HostAddress}}}}/US
Accept: application/json
